    ": pick 128 to 512 px for each side that should grow and press Extend. The page puts the picture on a larger canvas, fills the new part with the colours of the edge and masks it, a little way into the picture too, so the join blends. Say in the prompt what should be there and press Generate. The strength goes to 1, and the picture keeps its own pixels (": "：要加长的每一边选 128 到 512 像素，再按扩展。页面会把图放到更大的画布上，新区域先铺边缘的颜色并蒙住，还会稍微伸进原图，让接缝混在一起。在提示词里写那里应该有什么，再按生成。强度会变成 1，原图自己的像素会保留（",
