    "A link to a file on huggingface.co, or a Civitai model version (a link that ends in modelVersionId=...). The file goes into the models, loras or upscalers folder on the console, as picked in front of the link; a Civitai LoRA goes to loras by itself. A Civitai link of the form": "huggingface.co 上的文件链接，或 Civitai 的模型版本（链接以 modelVersionId= 结尾）。文件按链接前面选的种类进主机的 models、loras 或 upscalers；Civitai 的 LoRA 会自己进 loras。这种形式的 Civitai 链接",
    "A LoRA adds a style, a character or a look to a model. It works only with models of the family it was made for (SD 1.5, SDXL, FLUX…). Pick them on the Create tab, under Style: the box in front of one turns it off for a while and keeps its strength. Their order does not matter: sd.cpp adds them up. Under Models they are listed by the family they are made for, those for the model in use first.": "LoRA 给模型加风格、角色或样子。它只对它所属的模型家族起作用（SD 1.5、SDXL、FLUX……）。在「创作」的风格下面选用：前面的方框可以暂时关掉，强度仍保留。顺序无所谓，sd.cpp 会把它们加在一起。在「模型」里按家族排列，当前模型能用的排在前面。",
