    "DMD2 (anime) and SDXL-Lightning (photos) make SDXL models fast: CFG 1, 4 to 8 steps, sampler LCM for DMD2 and Euler for Lightning. CausVid does the same for Wan 2.1 1.3B videos: CFG 1, 4 steps. Adding one of them sets these settings; removing it again brings back the ones from before, unless you changed them. With DMD2 an SDXL image takes about 11 s instead of 29. It does not suit every finetune: if the image comes out grey and flat, try CFG 1.5 and 8 steps.": "DMD2（动漫）和 SDXL-Lightning（照片）能让 SDXL 变快：CFG 1，4 到 8 步，DMD2 用采样器 LCM，Lightning 用 Euler。CausVid 对 Wan 2.1 1.3B 视频同样：CFG 1，4 步。加上它们会改这些设置；再去掉时，若你没有改过，会回到之前的设置。用 DMD2 时，上游记录 SDXL 一张图大约 11 秒而不是 29 秒。它并不适合每个微调：若画面发灰发平，试 CFG 1.5 和 8 步。",
