    "The count next to Generate queues that many images as one run on the console. While a run is going, Generate adds the form's settings to the queue as one more run, and the page shows": "「生成」旁边的数量会在主机上排成一次任务。正在生成时再按「生成」，会把当前设置再排上一次，页面会显示",
