    "The key is on the TV, under the address. Spaces and dashes do not matter.": "密钥在电视上，地址的下面。空格和短横线无所谓。",
    "The larger Klein: more detail than the 4B, 1024x1024 in 8 steps with dpm2, about 2 min 20 s an image (4 steps with Euler take about 40 s). Works with FLUX.2 Klein 9B LoRAs. FLUX Non-Commercial License. 11.0 GB.": "更大的 Klein：比 4B 更细，1024×1024、dpm2、8 步，上游记录一张大约 2 分 20 秒（Euler、4 步大约 40 秒）。可用 FLUX.2 Klein 9B 的 LoRA。FLUX 非商业许可。11.0 GB。不是本机 12.20 的测量。",
    "The last prompts, kept on the console": "最近的提示词，保存在主机上",
    "The link must start with https://": "链接必须以 https:// 开头。",
