    "The model is switching. Try again in a moment.": "正在切换模型，请稍后再试。",
    "the name in the web UI": "网页上显示的名称",
    "The negative prompt": "负向提示词",
    "The new image follows the guide's layout: its edges with Canny on, the image itself with it off (a pose skeleton or a depth map, for a ControlNet that takes them). 0.5 is loose, 1 close.": "新图跟着引导图的构图走：打开 Canny 时用边缘，关掉时用图像本身（姿势骨架或深度图，给能接收它们的 ControlNet）。0.5 较松，1 较紧。",
    "The new part is masked and made from the prompt: say what should be there. A picture can grow to 4096 px on a side.": "新的部分会蒙住，并按提示词来画：写上那里应该有什么。一边最长可以到 4096 像素。",
    "the other preset stays": "另一个预设会留下",
    "The picture would be ": "画面会变成 ",
    "the PNG carries nothing: a copy of it tells nobody the prompt. The console keeps them next to the image, so the gallery's Info and Use all still work there. The switch is kept on the console. An API client sends": "之后，PNG 里什么都不带：拷走的文件看不出提示词。主机会把这些信息放在图像旁边，所以图库的「信息」和「全部使用」仍然可用。这个开关保存在主机上。API 客户端发送",
    "The preset puts this before the negative prompt: ": "预设会把这段加在负向提示词前面：",
    "The preset puts this before the prompt: ": "预设会把这段加在提示词前面：",
    "The preset's settings are back: ": "预设的设置已回来：",
    "The prompt and its negative prompt are back.": "提示词和负向提示词已填回。",
    "The prompt and the settings as text, as other tools paste them": "提示词和设置的文本，供别的工具粘贴",
    "The prompt can name the pictures \"image 1\" and \"image 2\", for example \"the cat from image 1 on the sofa of image 2\". ": "提示词里可以称它们为 image 1 和 image 2，例如「把 image 1 的猫放到 image 2 的沙发上」。",
    "The prompt is back.": "提示词已填回。",
    "The PS5 speeds its fan up when the chip gets near a target temperature, 91 °C on the console we measured. Until then the fan stays at about 23%, so the chip runs up to 90 °C and more during long runs. The modes lower that target, and the console's own fan control still sets the speed.": "PS5 在芯片接近目标温度时才会加快风扇。上游测到的目标是 91 °C。在那之前风扇大约停在 23%，所以长时间生成时芯片会到 90 °C 甚至更高。这些模式把目标调低，转速仍由主机自己的风扇控制决定。这不是本机 12.20 的测量。",
    "The queue": "队列",
    "The run was cancelled.": "这次生成已取消。",
    "The server is restarting": "服务器正在重启",
    "The server no longer has this job.": "服务器上已经没有这个任务。",
    "The server refused the request": "服务器拒绝了这个请求",
    "The settings from before ": "之前 ",
    "The settings in the file": "写在文件里的设置",
    "the settings of": "这些设置：",
    "the settings.": "是设置。",
    "The target goes down one degree every 20 seconds, because a big step at once drives the fan to almost full speed. It needs an ELF loader on port 9021, like the readings: PS5SD starts a small payload, ps5sd-fan. When PS5SD closes, or the mode is Quiet, the payload puts the console's own target back within 15 seconds and ends.": "目标每 20 秒降 1 度，因为一次降太多会把风扇打到几乎全速。它和读数一样需要 9021 端口上的 ELF 加载器：PS5SD 会启动一个小载荷 ps5sd-fan。PS5SD 关闭或模式回到安静时，载荷会在 15 秒内把主机自己的目标设回去并结束。",
    "the target you set, from 70 °C up to the console's own. The lower the target, the louder the fan.": "是你设的目标，从 70 °C 到主机自己的目标。目标越低，风扇越响。",
    "The temperature is the hottest of the chip's sensors; the power is the whole chip's (CPU, GPU and memory). The fan shows how hard it is driven, from 0 to 100%; its speed cannot be read. CPU is what PS5SD itself uses of the console's CPUs. GPU busy is the share of the time an image or video is made: the GPU has no reading of its own.": "温度是芯片各传感器里最高的；功耗是整颗芯片的（CPU、GPU 和内存）。风扇显示驱动程度，从 0 到 100%，读不到转速。CPU 是 PS5SD 自己占用的主机 CPU。GPU 忙碌是正在做图像或视频的时间比例：GPU 没有自己的占用读数。",
    "The TV does not show the API key now.": "电视现在不显示 API 密钥。",
    "The TV shows images and prompts again.": "电视会再次显示图像和提示词。",
