    "The TV shows the API key.": "电视会显示 API 密钥。",
    "The TV switch is kept on the console, for every browser. The upscaler is kept in this browser only.": "电视开关保存在主机上，所有浏览器共用。放大器只保存在这只浏览器里。",
    "The Upscale button under an image and in the gallery runs the upscaler picked in Settings over the image (4 times as wide and high for most). The result goes into the gallery.": "图像下面和图库里的「放大」会用设置里选的放大器处理这张图（多数是宽高各 4 倍）。结果进入图库。",
